                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Open-minded gamers will enjoy the quirky visuals and cheeky humour Wholetone Games bring to this taboo subject. With multiple endings there is a lot of replayability on offer.\n\nIf you have a dark sense of humour and are looking for a genuinely unique gaming experience then I highly recommend Oedipus Dating Sim. \n\nYou might even learn some Ancient Greek!",
